		(property "Description" "SparkFun MicroMod Teensy (DEV-16402, i.MX RT1062) in a TE 2199230-4 M.2 E-key socket. Pin numbers = M.2 pads; names = Teensyduino pin (core >= 1.56) + E30 gauge function. Drop-in for the Teensy 4.0 symbol (same pin positions). 3V3_IN pins are supply INPUTS: the card has no regulator. Place a MicroMod_Standoff on the footprint crosshair."
